# slug: ch81-replay
# source: chapters/ch81.tex:132
# label: alg:ch81-replay
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch81.tex:135
# caption: Replay a string-rewrite certificate against changing coordinates.

REQUIRE original string, trusted rule table, ordered rule/offset events
ENSURE verified descendant or first invalid event
FORALL events (r,i) in order DO
  check rule index and current substring extent
  require the current substring at i to equal rule r's left side
  replace that current occurrence with its right side
END FOR
return reconstructed descendant

